"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[8:9]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2433,{"id":{"$kq":13},"question_id":{"$kq":10},"text":"3．（1）示例：诚信互助，树景区文明之风。\n（2）B。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[9:11]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2434,{"id":{"$kq":16},"question_id":{"$kq":14},"text":"4．C。律诗四联依次为首联、颔联、颈联、尾联。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[11:12]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2435,{"id":{"$kq":19},"question_id":{"$kq":17},"text":"5．（1）未复有能与其奇者　（2）鸢飞戾天者\n（3）徙倚欲何依　（4）芳草萋萋鹦鹉洲\n（5）几处早莺争暖树　（6）馨香盈怀袖","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[14:17]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2436,{"id":{"$kq":23},"question_id":{"$kq":20},"text":"6．（1）雁；烟。\n（2）甲诗以“都护在燕然”写都护正在前线，借典故表达对边关将士建功报国的赞许；乙词以“燕然未勒归无计”写边功未成、不能归乡，表现守边责任和思乡之情交织。\n（3）甲诗以“征蓬”“归雁”自比，借远行的意象写出奉使途中的孤寂和漂泊感；乙词通过饮浊酒、夜不能寐、白发落泪等细节，抒发长期戍边者的思乡与苦闷。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[17:20]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2437,{"id":{"$kq":27},"question_id":{"$kq":24},"text":"7．昏黑无往来／时闻风铎／佛灯隐现林梢而已。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[20:21]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2438,{"id":{"$kq":30},"question_id":{"$kq":28},"text":"8．（1）考虑，想到。　（2）只是。\n（3）一起，共同。　（4）到，前往（游览）。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[21:23]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2439,{"id":{"$kq":33},"question_id":{"$kq":31},"text":"9．不再喝酒，也不再交谈，只是怀着宁静的心情面对眼前的景色。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[23:24]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2440,{"id":{"$kq":36},"question_id":{"$kq":34},"text":"10．苏轼把洒满庭院的月光比作一庭清澈的积水，把错落交映的竹柏影比作水中交错的水藻和荇菜，写出了月色的澄澈明净。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[24:25]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2441,{"id":{"$kq":39},"question_id":{"$kq":37},"text":"11．两处月色都很美；夜晚游人少，环境幽静。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[25:26]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2442,{"id":{"$kq":43},"question_id":{"$kq":40},"text":"12．②父亲年轻时在山里帮人炸石头；③父亲挑着一担粪去浇地；④临别时父亲爬树为“我”摘苦柚。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[28:29]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2443,{"id":{"$kq":46},"question_id":{"$kq":44},"text":"13．内容上，写“我”时常梦见父亲的背影，表现思念并奠定感情基调；结构上，开篇点题，引出下文几次看到父亲背影的往事，并与结尾呼应。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[29:30]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2444,{"id":{"$kq":49},"question_id":{"$kq":47},"text":"14．通过“脊背突起”“只裹着一张皮”等外貌描写和“低着头”“扶着方向盘”“弯着腰”等动作描写，具体写出父亲年老、瘦弱的姿态，表现“我”的惊讶与心疼。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[30:31]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2445,{"id":{"$kq":52},"question_id":{"$kq":50},"text":"15．不矛盾。喜欢父亲砸石头的背影，是敬佩父亲年轻时的强健与勤劳；忘不了一年多前所见的背影，是因为年迈的父亲仍为家人奔忙，“我”既心疼、愧疚，又思念他。两种感情都源于对父亲的爱。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[31:32]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2446,{"id":{"$kq":56},"question_id":{"$kq":53},"text":"16．①《西行漫记》；②埃德加·斯诺。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[33:34]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2447,{"id":{"$kq":60},"question_id":{"$kq":57},"text":"17．（1）飞夺泸定桥。\n（2）政治工作者及时解释作战意义、鼓舞士气；先锋部队纪律严明、吃苦耐劳，日夜兼程，抢得先机；战士信念坚定、勇于牺牲，主动承担夺桥任务。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[34:36]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}],[2448,{"id":{"$kq":63},"question_id":{"$kq":61},"text":"18．作文略。","status":"非官方参考答案","provenance_kind":"supplied_reference","official":false,"coverage":"available","limitations":"原参考答案仅列“作文略”。","source_path":{"$kq":75},"source_anchor":"docx:paragraphs[37:38]","source_sha256":{"$kq":76},"batch":"20261118_四卷补录"}]],"exam_items":[[3462,{"id":{"$kq":77},"paper_id":"八上|26-81-M","number":"1","number_key":"1","question_ids":[{"$kq":0}],"block":"基础积累与语言运用","type":null,"ability":null,"theme":null,"genre":null,"task":"结合采访语段完成写词、注音、词语辨析和病句修改","question_text":{"$kq":2},"answer":null,"score":8,"group_score":8,"score_group_key":"1","type_eligible":false,"them